      "id": "P-PDM-01",
      "anchor": "p-pdm-01",
      "title": "P-PDM-01（矩形等距的精确维数方向）。",
      "author_title": "矩形等距的精确维数方向",
      "premises": [
        "α、β为任意有限载体，标量为ℂ；所用单位矩阵和乘法是实际矩形矩阵运算。"
      ],
      "quantified_scope": "All finite source and target carriers, including empty carriers; no density input or pre-supplied isometry is needed for existence.",
      "claim": "有限复载体α、β上，存在J:Matrix β α ℂ满足J†J=Iα，当且仅当|α|≤|β|；若|α|<|β|，任意这样的扩维矩阵不能同时有JJ†=Iβ。",
      "main_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_matrix_isometry_iff_card_le",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.matrix_isometry_not_coisometry_of_card_lt"
      ],
      "support_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.coordinateIsometry",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.coordinateIsometry_adjoint_mul",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.card_le_of_matrix_isometry"
      ],
      "witnesses": [
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.direct_adjoint_mul",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.direct_not_coisometry",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.reverse_full_isometry_impossible"
      ],
      "proof_outline": [
        "有限基数界给单射；其0/1坐标矩阵逐项满足J†J=I。",
        "必要性由rank(I)=|α|≤rank(J)≤|β|；反向单位恒等式在严格维数差时违反同一必要界。"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "不把单侧矩形等距称为双侧酉。",
        "不讨论无限维载体或物理制备复杂度。"
      ],
