    {
      "id": "P-PDM-02",
      "anchor": "p-pdm-02",
      "title": "P-PDM-02（任意实际纯化的有方向直接等距）。",
      "author_title": "任意实际纯化的有方向直接等距",
      "premises": [
        "ι、α、β为有限复载体。",
        "IsPure仍为全部实际密度态中的凸极点。",
        "实际discardRight边际相同。",
        "明确维数方向|α|≤|β|。"
      ],
      "quantified_scope": "Every pair of full convex-pure joint density matrices with the stated marginal and cardinal conditions; the vector theorem also handles unnormalized vectors with equal outer-product marginals.",
      "claim": "同一有限系统的任意两份完整凸纯态Ψ∈Density(ι×α)、Φ∈Density(ι×β)，在实际偏迹相同且|α|≤|β|时，存在J†J=Iα使Φ=(Iι⊗J)Ψ(Iι⊗J)†；向量作用为φ(i,b)=Σa J(b,a)ψ(i,a)。",
      "main_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.pure_states_isometrically_equivalent",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_auxiliary_isometry_of_equal_marginal",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_auxiliary_isometry_action"
      ],
      "support_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.auxiliary_tensor_mul",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.auxiliaryEmbeddingChannel_discard_operator",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_auxiliary_unitary_of_equal_marginal",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.IsPure.exists_vector"
      ],
      "witnesses": [
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.first_pure",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.second_pure",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.first_marginal",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.second_marginal",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.exact_rectangular_vector_action",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.exact_rectangular_density_action",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.generic_direct_isometry_instantiated"
      ],
      "proof_outline": [
        "先从维数界构造J0并将第一向量等距扩展至目标辅助载体，实际偏迹不变。",
        "同载体Gram/酉定理给U，定义J=U J0；由真实矩阵/Kronecker乘法得到作用。",
        "完整纯性反向取得两向量，再用outer(Tv)=T outer(v) T†回到任意纯态密度矩阵。"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "不声称反向维数方向存在全空间等距。",
        "右矩阵因子为AJᵀ；不将J†、Jᵀ、逐项共轭互换。",
        "不从该结构事实推出Core唯一选择复模型。"
      ],
