      "id": "P-PDM-03",
      "anchor": "p-pdm-03",
      "title": "P-PDM-03（全部凸纯扩展的实际秩下界）。",
      "author_title": "全部凸纯扩展的实际秩下界",
      "premises": [
        "有限复载体与原Density/IsPure定义。",
        "系统边际为原实际Kraus偏迹。"
      ],
      "quantified_scope": "Every full convex-pure joint density, without a pre-supplied rank-one or Gram witness.",
      "claim": "任意Ψ∈Density(ι×α)若在完整态空间中为凸纯态，则rankℂ(Trα Ψ)≤|α|；实际向量重排A满足Trα Ψ=AA†且rank(AA†)=rank(A)。",
      "main_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.rank_marginal_le_auxiliary_card"
      ],
      "support_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.IsPure.exists_vector",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.discard_vectorize_outer"
      ],
      "witnesses": [
