    {
      "id": "P-PDM-04",
      "anchor": "p-pdm-04",
      "title": "P-PDM-04（有限复纯化的精确最小辅助维数）。",
      "author_title": "有限复纯化的精确最小辅助维数",
      "premises": [
        "ρ为完整有限复密度态，正性与迹一为实际矩阵条件。",
        "辅助载体有限，秩为原复矩阵的精确秩。",
        "只复用固定数学库的有限Hermitian谱定理；不预设谱支撑大小或所需纯化。"
      ],
      "quantified_scope": "All finite complex density inputs and all specified finite auxiliary carriers; attained explicitly on Fin ρ.matrix.rank.",
      "claim": "任意ρ:Density ι与指定有限α，有实际完整凸纯扩展Ψ∈Density(ι×α)、TrαΨ=ρ，当且仅当ρ.matrix.rank≤|α|。Fin rank上真实达到最小值；任何更小辅助均不可能。密度秩严格为正，空辅助不可能。",
      "main_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_purification_iff_rank_le",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_minimal_purification",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.no_purification_of_card_lt_rank",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.density_rank_pos",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.no_purification_empty_auxiliary"
      ],
      "support_declarations": [
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.SpectralSupport",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.spectralSupport_card",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.supportedGram",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.supportedGram_spec",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.supportPurification_isPure",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.supportPurification_marginal",
        "UEOTQM.QuantumPurification.exists_purification_of_rank_le"
      ],
      "witnesses": [
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.mixed_rank_two",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.mixed_has_two_dimensional_purification",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.mixed_no_one_dimensional_purification",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.mixed_exact_dimension_criterion",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.pure_rank_one",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.pure_has_unit_auxiliary",
        "UEOTQM.PurificationDimensionExamples.pure_no_empty_auxiliary"
      ],
      "proof_outline": [
        "必要性由任意纯化秩下界。",
        "PSD给真实非负特征值及谱酉；仅取非零特征值索引，平方根加权列构成压缩Gram因子。",
        "正性保证平方根平方回到特征值，零特征值项逐项为零，故压缩后的实际Gram仍为ρ。",
        "向量化获得规范纯态与实际偏迹；非零特征值个数等于实际秩，再由坐标等距嵌入任意足够大的目标。",
        "取Fin rank得到达到性；假设秩0则得到空载体迹一密度，矛盾。"
      ],
      "limits": [
        "精确秩区别严格零与任意小的非零特征值。",
        "noncomputable谱选择不是有舍入误差保证的可执行谱算法。",
        "不覆盖近似纯化的最优资源、无限维、稳定秩或制备电路复杂度。"
      ],
